{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-05_end","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-05","title":"谁的战争","storyCode":"12-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"ad6459f3ac2f19f92472eff123caa509820b969e7cd2f2138b96277a147a5096","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"号角和Misery掩护自救军撤离，最后的蒸汽骑士在关键时刻出现。W赶到支援费斯特小队。而诺伯特区的格拉斯哥帮却陷入了物资匮乏的窘境。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我这里......真的没有什么东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别装蒜！我们看得一清二楚，你用过炉子，你从哪里搞到的吃的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你每天都能搞到吃的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我......只是碰巧捡到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捡到？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_417_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别弄得太过火，小心这小子急性矿石病发作，害得我们一起完蛋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的仓库到底在哪里？说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的......只是捡到......有人把东西放在了我的窗台上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不老实——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_334","isRemote":false,"text":"他的话就那么不值得你们相信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_334","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者偶尔也会走运一回，捡到点吃的吧。这又有什么稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饥饿的暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是谁？也是来抢东西的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_334","isRemote":false,"text":"你们好，我叫雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_334","isRemote":false,"text":"以前在乌萨斯的时候，他们也叫我“红刀”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"加快速度，跟上我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再坚持一下！我们就快到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，他们的人越来越多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白狼，我听过你和你家族的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很高兴今天能在这里和你并肩而战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了我们的伦蒂尼姆，为了我们的维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想干什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"别停下，继续跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的叛徒和维多利亚的虫子们，这场没完没了的追逐战也该结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想跑到哪里去？你们想逃过自己的死亡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，你们的那些躲在暗处的朋友，都会被我们撕碎，这是你们欠我们的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是伦蒂尼姆，是维多利亚，是这片大地的每一个人欠我们的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑吧，跑吧，你们跑不过风暴，跑不过战争！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭上你的嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啧，人太多了，必须想办法突破这里！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我只剩下最后一枚榴弹......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗本，带好这枚榴弹。往下走，直接炸开动力层的底层甲板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Misery，保护好他们，你们还要继续往前走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了，放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的，就交给运气吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角，你要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭上你的嘴，我没空再给你一拳头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"号角转过身，面对着如潮水一般涌来的敌人。\n她微微扯了扯嘴角，这一切也该结束了。\n这些逃亡，这些战斗，这些彻夜难眠的夜晚。\n军人本就该死在战争中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......风笛现在怎么样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她握紧武器，准备冲锋。\n阴云笼罩的天空下，一阵奇怪的声音传来，由远及近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"很熟悉的声音，只是很久没有再在伦蒂尼姆城内响起。\n人们只有在久远的回忆与模糊的传言中才能找到那个声音的来源——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"号角，走，趁这个机会！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“最后的蒸汽骑士”","speakerId":"avg_npc_651_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉闷的喷气声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“最后的蒸汽骑士”","speakerId":"avg_npc_651_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“维多利亚”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，这些门——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太厚了，对面听不到我们的声音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，克洛维希娅和凯瑟琳都被他们带走了，是想用她们作为和萨卡兹交换的条件吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人，这些可耻的叛徒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闪灵小姐，你能不能打开这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不能再耽搁了，我们不知道那些萨卡兹们什么时候会过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！别！别闹出那么大的动静！这样只会更快地引来敌人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里的都是重伤员和非战斗人员，如果真的和王庭的人开打了，我们走得掉，他们怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是等在这里一样是死。我不知道我的那些朋友们打的什么主意，但我猜不会只是把我们放在这里不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的无人机上有个小型激光切割装置，这些钢板很厚，但只要再给我点时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要多少时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急！我得先测试功率......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，还记得老比尔的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定是......一定是那种怪物又混进了我们之中，他又一次欺骗了我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们太大意了，我们应该早点发现的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那种能够变换外貌的萨卡兹......费斯特，会不会这里也有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有那种东西存在，我们到底......该信任谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......不是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那些人是我们的战友！那些人也是伦蒂尼姆的工人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我和他们一起长大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这就是他们自己的选择，汤米、帕特和戴，他们和别人一起做出了这个决定呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，为什么......他们明明是我们的同伴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接受同伴被顶替总比承认同伴的背叛来得要容易一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这件事还是这么发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能猜到一点他们的想法，等到愤怒带来的热血消散后，继续选择战斗并不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅说过，说到底，我们不过是些普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须承认......就连我，都同样恐惧离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃避和退缩，是我们每个普通人在面对一场战争时......最下意识的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你大可以留下！和你的那些朋友们一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会这么做，洛洛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须认清恐惧，才能警醒自己......勇气的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我愿意相信，他们还不至于真的跨过那条线。我愿意相信，他们只是被恐惧所裹挟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这些都无关紧要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会救出奶奶和克洛维希娅的，和上次一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这些伤员耽搁不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机的激光切割装置已经在工作了！大概需要......呃，二十分钟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也来帮忙，我随身带了些工具！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的锤子和扳手在这里派不上用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耐心点，我们再等一会，就可以这么安静地离开这......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么？我没监听到萨卡兹的行动啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闪灵小姐——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，闪灵，好久不见。听说你去了家族聚会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......W，你来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W！现在半个伦蒂尼姆都听到这里的动静了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很隆重，对吧，我对炸药的分量把握得一直很准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说凯尔希被揍得很惨，于是就百忙之中抽空来看看咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，果然很惨，特雷西斯还真是不留情面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为那男人会对自己的“老朋友”温柔一点呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"她还没醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还真是遗憾，我该为她挤出几滴泪吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，趁机让这个老女人再也不敢得罪我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（喑哑的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这东西倒居然还活着吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（威胁的低吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，怎么还这么凶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr受损很严重，直到两个小时以前才重新恢复运动机能，但我仍然不建议你去惹它，W。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是在救它主子的命，它起码应该学着更尊重我一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则的话，哼哼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（妥协的低鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还差不多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王庭军的人正在赶过来！快点，我们得在他们来之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别吵吵嚷嚷的，可露希尔，耳朵疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为都是谁的错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就快点让你的人迈开腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在伦蒂尼姆城外倒是有几个好去处，要来瞧瞧吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的物资，如果以最好的情况来估计，还能再撑上一个星期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果以最坏的情况来估计呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和卡铎尔会继续想办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的情况现在怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个平常住着一万人不到的街区，被塞进来了数倍的人口，没有额外的补给，没有警察和法律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过了这么些天，我们还活着，这就已经该感谢市民们那些残存的道德了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许只是卡铎尔的拳头足够硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有听到大公爵们的动向吗？我听说......温德米尔公爵的军队驻地离这里应该不远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......应该不会对我们的境遇视而不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"零星有些传言......有人说，在夜晚看到过划过的火光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都见过萨卡兹那个飞在天上的东西......我们刚被扔出伦蒂尼姆的那天，它的影子划过了整个地块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，大公爵们都很忌惮那东西，他们现在只敢试探性地发起进攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也有可能外面已经打得昏天黑地，伦蒂尼姆城被炸了个稀巴烂，天知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会不会是大公爵们不知道地块上还有人活着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......他们以为......我们都已经死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们能把消息传出去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么传？城际通讯网络早就瘫痪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这些被困在封锁区的可怜虫，还是担心下明天的口粮吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真不敢想象，好像就在几天前，我们还在录像厅里看蓝卡坞的那些烂片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那部片子叫什么来着？《变种怪杰大乱战》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结局其实还蛮感人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，我睡着了，就看到最后的爆炸把那座移动城市炸上了天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只记得麦克拉伦先生的钱给得倒是很大方，毕竟我们确实帮他的录像厅摆平过很多次麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿他现在还好，现在外面的环境恐怕对他的神经衰弱没有好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去录像厅看过，他把门封得很严实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你为什么总喜欢在录像厅睡觉？我们第一次认识，也是因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你的笑声把我吵醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，可那个片子真的很好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，是在录像厅睡觉的你不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里睡觉很舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个喜剧导演很有名的，我有她全部的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"代表饥饿的咕噜声不合时宜地响起，打破了好不容易才稍显轻松的气氛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你吃得有些太少了，这样你没法保持体力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，我们得继续撑下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们曾经的生活就这么结束了。一转眼，一切就变成了现在的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到处是疯子，到处是尸体，还有萨卡兹建起的封锁墙......这些天不是没人试过突破那里，他们的脑袋现在还挂在墙边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我至今也没想明白，怎么就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争爆发了，贝尔德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道！可就是因为“战争爆发了”这轻飘飘的几个字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的过去就在一瞬间烟消云散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是谁的战争？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵们是为了保护维多利亚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，它不属于我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一阵细碎的响动从黑暗中传来，还有罐头与罐头轻轻碰撞的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天不是你守夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大衣里藏的是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"别......别过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["闪灵"]}]}
